  "lazyAsyncPoint2": "The first getAsync builds it; every caller at the same time waits for that one build",
  "lazyAsyncPoint3": "CobaltAsyncBuilder shows loading once — a screen opened later renders it at once",
  "lazyAsyncPoint4": "A failed build is not remembered, so retry builds again",
